  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While ten formless Gu Immortal divine consciousnesses open Hu Immortal Inheritance on Tian Ti, one praises Myriad Dragon Dock’s Ying Sheng Ji as very outstanding and says Long Nǚ has taught him well. After Feng Jin Huang enters first, Xiao Qi Xing, Ying Sheng Ji, and others follow through the gatehouse.",
      "chapters": [
        365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "fac_myriad_dragon_dock",
        "char_long_nu",
        "char_feng_jin_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among Central Continent elite disciples, Feng Jin Huang, Ying Sheng Ji, and Xiao Qi Xing sit in the first tier, with Gu Immortal backing and careful nurturing from the start.",
      "chapters": [
        366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_xiao_qi_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Crane Sect’s He Feng Yang later lists Myriad Dragon Dock’s Ying Sheng Ji beside Spirit Affinity House’s Feng Jin Huang and Spirit Butterfly Valley’s Xiao Qi Xing as juniors Immortal Crane Sect cannot match in open contention.",
      "chapters": [
        375
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "char_he_feng_yang",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes his appearance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the climb for Hu Immortal Inheritance, Fang Zheng surpasses ten-sect elites until only Xiao Qi Xing, Ying Sheng Ji, and Feng Jin Huang remain above him.",
      "chapters": [
        388
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "climb-on-dang-hun-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_hu_immortal_inheritance",
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Zheng’s climb leaves Ying Sheng Ji furthest from the peak, Ying Sheng Ji sighs, lets go, and falls. The land spirit transports him out of the blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        398
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "climb-on-dang-hun-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among Gu Immortal seeds gathered against divine bean soldiers, Ying Sheng Ji reports that he has killed many soldiers without gains yet.",
      "chapters": [
        2011
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "painting-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the battle he continuously takes out doctor Gu in human form and saves people across the field.",
      "chapters": [
        2012
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "painting-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_doctor_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the fight he sighs that the street was once filled with rich vitality, then hears Wei Wu Shang remind the group that the painting world is Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable’s killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        2013
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "painting-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_wu_shang",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, with Xiao Qi Xing at the front, Fairy Bi Xia, Sun Yuan Hua, Sun Yao, Ying Sheng Ji, Chen Da Jiang, and the rest appear together. Shen Shang names that group the ten children of human path, Gu Immortal seeds Heavenly Court is cultivating for human path.",
      "chapters": [
        2065
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "painting-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
